# Static trusted IPv4/CIDR entries.
# Format:
#   IPv4[/prefix] [# comment]
#
# Dynamic router addresses must NOT be listed here. They come from Router IP Push.
# Add permanent VPS/admin networks here or with `riph-admin trusted-add`.

127.0.0.1/32          # localhost
# 203.0.113.10/32     # example trusted VPS
# 198.51.100.0/24     # example trusted network
